%description:
Tests the AccECN fallback of a retransmitted SYN-ACK (RFC 9768 section
3.2.3.2.2). The tester removes the SYN-ACK with the AccECN option, its first
retransmission (B002, AccECN flags without the option) and the next ones, so
the client gets B004 with (AE,CWR,ECE) = (0,0,0) and uses no ECN. The server
"remains in AccECN feedback mode", so its segments carry the ACE field, but
after the (0,0,0) SYN-ACK it "MUST NOT set ECT on any packet for the rest of
the connection" (section 3.1.5): B007 is Not-ECT.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="12.0 1000"
*.srv_app.sendScript="13.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.tcptester.script="b1 delete; b2 delete; b3 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP AccECN0(e0b=1,ceb=0,e1b=1)# deleting
[3.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S E W N 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[3.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A S W 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[3.003 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[9.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[9.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[9.003 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[9.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
[9.005 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[12.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[12.203 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384 
[13.001 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N 501:1501(1000) ack 1001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
